WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:02.060
I'm Nia. I'm twenty-one.

2
00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:06.460
Before all this, Thursday nights were
for dance rehearsal with my friends.

3
00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:10.640
In March, I was diagnosed with
acute myeloid leukemia.

4
00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:16.940
It's a fast-growing blood cancer.

5
00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:22.100
I started chemotherapy, and my doctors said
I would need a blood stem cell transplant.

6
00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:25.560
My care team began searching
for a matching donor.

7
00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:31.440
These days, I watch rehearsal videos
from my hospital bed.

8
00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:34.040
I still practice the steps with my hands.

9
00:00:34.460 --> 00:00:36.040
I miss them so much.

10
00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:44.400
Last week my team found
a matching donor.

11
00:00:44.740 --> 00:00:46.020
I'm still in treatment.

12
00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:50.240
Getting back will take time, but now
I'm picturing myself there again.
